---
title: "RefreshCoordinator 刷新会话相位机（CM-7 R1）"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "单个刷新会话相位" as session {
    [*] --> io: StartRefresh<br/>捕获 epochGen=gen
    io --> durable: FinishIO<br/>成功写快照/失败不写
    durable --> validating: EnterValidate<br/>抢到 commitMutex
    validating --> writing: ValidateEpoch<br/>重读 selected + isFresh 校验
    writing --> [*]: WritePublish<br/>validated→落地/否则丢弃+1
    note right of writing
      ★ R1 拆步：校验（授权时刻）与
      write（生效时刻）之间编辑可插入——
      commitMutex 只串行化发布者，
      编辑不抢锁（guard.log 实证）
    end note
  }
  state "编辑子机（全局单一）" as editing {
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> inEdit: BeginEdit<br/>gen+1, inFlightEdits+1
    inEdit --> inEdit: SwitchSelection<br/>selected 翻转
    inEdit --> idle: EndEdit<br/>gen+1, inFlightEdits-1
    note right of inEdit
      ★ 可在 writing 态内（ValidateEpoch 之后、
      WritePublish 之前）插入——
      InvNoCrossAccountPollution
      反例的来源交错
    end note
  }
  state "补偿重发（Republishing*UseCase）" as republish {
    [*] --> ready
    ready --> ready: EditRepublish (~editing ∧ ~commitHeld)<br/>commitSerialized 不校验 epoch（可重复触发）
  }
  note left of session
    不变量①a：refresh 帧 capGen ≥ edit 帧水位
    （拆 epoch 比对必被抓——able-to-fail 闭环）
    不变量②：帧落地瞬间 src == 当时 selected
    （R1 反例如实交付：校验通过后才切走）
    不变量③：快照单调不降（失败路径无写机制）
  end note
